Reason: port: with frame_rate = 60 or 120 a held sound effect is requested on every displayed frame but JAI's frame work runs on one in two or four, and a second request in one frame work stopped and restarted the sound (the Rocket and Turbo charge sound was never heard); the stops also queued an SE track's port command twice, which dropped the BGM volume updates queued after it (Shadow Mario's music stayed loud everywhere)
--- a/libs/JSystem/src/JAudio/JAInterface/JAIEntrySe.cpp
+++ b/libs/JSystem/src/JAudio/JAInterface/JAIEntrySe.cpp
@@ -3,6 +3,28 @@
 #include <JSystem/JAudio/JAInterface/JAIBasic.hpp>
